<<SetBGSprite CobblerShop>>

With Mochi Uncle's question about his potential contribution weighing on his mind, Raju returns during the mid-morning repair period. Ready to demonstrate rather than simply describe how he might assist in preserving traditional cobbling skills.

The cobbler shop hums with rhythmic sounds of traditional craftsmanship as Raju arrives. Mochi Uncle balances active repair work with careful attention to detail. Today carries special significance - yesterday's honest conversation about family tradition has established an atmosphere of mutual evaluation.

