<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Serious">>
MochiUncle: One wrong movement can ruin expensive shoes or injure yourself.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Serious">>
MochiUncle: Traditional methods require perfect precision and years of practice.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
