MochiUncle: But you start with basic tool care and simple cleaning only.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Serious">>
MochiUncle: No cutting or stitching until you prove you understand the discipline that traditional craftsmanship requires.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Thank you for sharing your knowledge, uncle!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I'll be the most careful and respectful student you've ever had for traditional techniques.

<<HideCharacter>>
As Raju begins his introduction to traditional cobbling techniques, both understand his choice to focus on fundamental skills represents commitment to understanding the technical foundation of centuries-old craftsmanship. The decision to start with basic tool care reflects respect for the complexity of traditional methods.

