title: MochiUncle_Day4a
tags:
---
<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite CobblerShop>>

After yesterday's selection of his specific contribution area, Raju arrives at the cobbler shop early to begin implementing his chosen approach before the day's repair work begins.

The cobbler shop welcomes Raju's early arrival as he prepares to put yesterday's commitments into practice. The morning calm provides ideal conditions for beginning his chosen role. Mochi Uncle's evaluation today will determine whether his assistance becomes meaningful or remains well-intentioned but impractical.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Serious">>
MochiUncle: Ready for your first real day of traditional craft work, beta?

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Serious">>
MochiUncle: Today you'll discover whether your enthusiasm can handle the actual demands.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Serious">>
MochiUncle: Of preserving centuries-old techniques.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I'm completely ready, uncle!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I've been thinking about this opportunity all night.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I'm eager to prove that my respect for traditional crafts can translate into meaningful contribution.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Serious">>
MochiUncle: We'll see how you handle the precision required when working with traditional tools.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Serious">>
MochiUncle: And methods.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Serious">>
MochiUncle: Craftsmanship tests both your technical skills and your patience under demanding conditions.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I understand, uncle.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: But I believe that helping preserve traditional skills will teach me valuable lessons.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: About quality, patience, and the importance of cultural knowledge.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Smiling">>
MochiUncle: Your attitude shows promise, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Smiling">>
MochiUncle: Now let's see if your performance matches your reverence for traditional methods.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Smiling">>
MochiUncle: Real craftsmanship begins now.

<<HideCharacter>>
As the morning work session intensifies with Raju taking on his designated responsibilities, both understand the next few hours will provide definitive evidence of whether his assistance represents genuine value. The hands-on work creates mounting pressure that will test not only technical abilities but also capacity to maintain quality.

