title: MochiUncle_Day5
---
<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite CobblerShop>>

After successfully completing his first full day of traditional craft work, Raju returns for a second day. Eager to build on yesterday's experience and continue proving his value to preserving traditional cobbling skills.

The familiar sights and sounds of the cobbler shop greet Raju as he returns with growing confidence. Yesterday's successful navigation of precision work pressure validated both his capabilities and Mochi Uncle's decision to trust him. The second day carries different energy as both move beyond experimental assistance into genuine knowledge transfer partnership.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Smiling">>
MochiUncle: You returned, beta!

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Smiling">>
MochiUncle: Yesterday was quite remarkable.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Smiling">>
MochiUncle: You showed more respect for traditional methods than I expected.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Smiling">>
MochiUncle: Are you prepared to deepen your understanding today?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Absolutely, uncle!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Yesterday taught me so much about traditional craftsmanship.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: And the patience required for quality work.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I feel like I understand your knowledge much more deeply now.

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Smiling">>
MochiUncle: Excellent!

<<SetCharacterExpression "MochiUncle" "Smiling">>
