As the second day of collaboration unfolds with expanded responsibilities and higher expectations, both Raju and Mochi Uncle recognize they are moving beyond the experimental phase into a potentially meaningful relationship. The progression from basic introduction to more complex techniques reflects growing mutual trust and competence.

